Subject: [PATCH] tests: match manually registered GObject type callbacks

Give the basics test's base/class/instance callbacks their GType signatures
and remove their registration casts. Match the separate module class
initializer in the threaded dynamic test as well.

Keep the assertions, registration paths, thread/ref counts and typed signal
and public-interface callback tests unchanged.

